      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Just as I thought... an Old Growth Ent!\nThis could've become a dire situation.",
        "Jp" : "やはり《オールドグロウ・エント》――！\nまずい事態かもしれないわ"
