      "MsgSerial" : 286170,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Something similar happened before.\nAn Old Growth Ent suddenly appeared\nin the ritual grounds and rapidly grew\ninto a colossal tree, a Grand Ent,\nlarge enough to blot out the sky.",
        "Jp" : "実はね、昔も同じようなことがあったのよ\n年経たエントが突然祭祀場に現れて\n急激に短時間で空を覆うほどの巨木\n《グランエント》に成長したの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286171,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Back then, we managed to slay it with the combined\nefforts of many knights and Arisen, but...",
        "Jp" : "その時は、大勢の騎士と覚者が総がかりで\nなんとか討伐できたんだけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286172,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Since the fall of the White Dragon,\nthey say that Dragon Force tends to\nstagnate around the ritual grounds.\nThat's why the White Knights patrol the area.",
        "Jp" : "白竜様が墜ちてから、祭祀場のあたりは\n竜力が淀みやすくなったと言われているわ\nだから白衛騎士団もあの場所を定期的に\nチェックしているのよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286173,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Anyway, thank you for investigating this.\nShould you find an Old Growth Ent,\nplease do your best to slay it in the future.",
        "Jp" : "ともあれ、今回は調査をありがとう\nオールドグロウ・エントを発見したら\n今後もできるだけ退治してちょうだい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286174,
      "MsgType" : 0,
